1
00:00:00,832 --> 00:00:02,462
(Bernadette:)Okay, Sheldon.

2
00:00:02,626 --> 00:00:07,586
(Bernadette:)What happens to our neuroreceptors
when we don't get enough REM sleep?

3
00:00:09,299 --> 00:00:12,639
(Sheldon:)They lose their sensitivity to serotonin
and norepinephrine.

4
00:00:12,803 --> 00:00:13,843
Which leads to...?

5
00:00:14,012 --> 00:00:16,802
(Sheldon:)Impaired cognitive function.

6
00:00:16,973 --> 00:00:21,103
(Bernadette:)Right. So march in there,
brush your teeth and go to bed.

7
00:00:21,937 --> 00:00:24,227
But I don't wanna go to bed.

8
00:00:25,982 --> 00:00:28,072
I'm gonna count to three. One--

9
00:00:28,235 --> 00:00:29,815
(Sheldon:)Oh, all right.

10
00:00:33,907 --> 00:00:36,247
(Leonard:)That was amazing
how you handled him.

11
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:38,410
(Bernadette:)I know how to deal
with stubborn children.

12
00:00:38,578 --> 00:00:41,918
(Bernadette:)My mother used to run an illegal
daycare center in our basement.

13
00:00:48,255 --> 00:00:50,255
[MAN CACKLING]

14
00:00:55,262 --> 00:00:58,602
Leonard. You're giggling in your sleep.

15
00:00:58,765 --> 00:01:01,355
It's not me. It's my new ring tone.

